OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADavey promises tax cuts for millions if
OL,4,AUK rejoins EU single market
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe claimed the plan would mean a #680
OL,7,Fcut for "most taxpayers" but it would
OL,8,Fnot come into full effect until the
OL,9,Ffifth year of a Lib Dem government -
OL,10,Fpotentially up to eight years away.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
