OL,3,AUS to build two military bases in
OL,4,AGreenland under new deal with Denmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US, Denmark and Greenland have
OL,7,Fsigned a defence deal that allows
OL,8,FWashington to build two new military
OL,9,Fbases in the Arctic territory, while
OL,10,Freaffirming Copenhagen's sovereignty
OL,11,Fover it.
OL,13,FBefore a signing ceremony at the UN
OL,14,FGeneral Assembly in New York, US
OL,15,FPresident Donald Trump said "we will
OL,16,Fimmediately begin the process of
OL,17,Fdeveloping a large military presence in
OL,18,Fthe appropriate locations".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
