OL,3,AHow Ceuta, football and Israel are
OL,4,Ashaping Morocco's election
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisillusioned young voters in Morocco
OL,7,Fwere courted with viral football
OL,8,Fslogans, promises of one million jobs
OL,9,Fand anti-Israel rallying calls ahead of
OL,10,FWednesday's parliamentary elections.
OL,12,FYet, for many young Moroccans, politics
OL,13,Fremains deeply disconnected from
OL,14,Freality.
OL,16,F"I have no hope for this election. I'm
OL,17,Fashamed of our political scene. It's a
OL,18,Fcomplete circus," Siham Azeroual, 32,
OL,19,Fan environmental activist who lives in
OL,20,Fthe Atlas region, tells the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
