OL,3,ASri Lanka court convicts 15 men over
OL,4,Adeadly Easter Sunday bombings
OL,5,
OL,6,FSri Lanka's High Court has given long
OL,7,Fjail sentences to 15 men charged with
OL,8,Fplotting the 2019 Easter Sunday bomb
OL,9,Fattacks that killed 270 people and
OL,10,Finjured more than 500.
OL,12,FThose found guilty include Naufer
OL,13,FMoulavi, who prosecutors said
OL,14,Fmasterminded the suicide bombings. Nine
OL,15,Fother men were acquitted.
OL,17,FThe co-ordinated blasts at three
OL,18,Fchurches and three luxury hotels were
OL,19,Fthe deadliest in Sri Lanka since the
OL,20,Fend of its civil war in 2009.
OL,21,FForty-five foreigners were among the
OL,22,Fdead.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
